{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e67980a1507d12598f7c8a07ab30354f5bbb6b0694befd6803182522f91cda2e",
      "text": "作为嘉宾出演益智问答节目的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ababbc4d665534de5aa03cad279e3e9d7407365bccc1fcced96ecd5e76a8eaf",
      "text": "辛……咦？地上掉了东西。\n这是……单词本……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c6f173990148ad326a49fb235e75873e2f225cc6b2654d206447e9bf18da3d4",
      "text": "啊，那是……不好意思，是我的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2bc7a61cb3374ec153fd4abe92c9532c6e1c1a199091aadf222a5c22f60438a",
      "text": "刚才休息时拿出来用了，\n好像不小心掉在了地上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d533fc2abc9d267c435657b670815dc32e0ce0aec3c2523a747179c37ab49d5f",
      "text": "原来是旬先生的啊。平时都会随身带着吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d659379f8363379f27e7c42d4984d5fe7e2ecb19ef1f81bb50773ed7e2ed1388",
      "text": "不是的，这是为了下次去当嘉宾的\n益智问答节目准备的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7bf303589689b475f87a31e4c9724f7cc7d6c68b4b7555f87e08512fc8ff920",
      "text": "因为是知名音乐家特辑那一期，\n所以想着重新系统地学习一遍。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fc4396aab780a107f494fc2347402f80ab0d5c793be724bc627c36477eb4ca3",
      "text": "我还会在学校课间或者路上拿这个\n让夏来给我出题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2f4b061893314ebc16235d47453d400e3153cb84737901d9a80545edb37ac0d",
      "text": "虽然我具备一定的音乐知识，\n但并不知道节目会出什么样的题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59f199a01e438c6798434a428886e5ec14b143c63d68bbe067c5c0cf54de4700",
      "text": "真是下了不少功夫呢。\n是旬先生的话一定能拿到冠军的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_03:1_5_021_03:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fbb44a74113c2a2ae417a2a7cfd5584cb2ab0d6ad918bf8e929cb63928b8441",
      "text": "我觉得没那么简单，不过也是呢……\n既然参加了，我就会以夺冠为目标的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
